or, like, where it's, like, the design of the game...

00:37:33.380 --> 00:37:35.220
is, like, makes it unfairly hard.

00:37:35.280 --> 00:37:38.180
Rather than the design of the game makes it hard intentionally,

00:37:38.240 --> 00:37:39.360
is what it felt.

00:37:39.360 --> 00:37:40.320
I don't doubt the intentionality.

00:37:40.980 --> 00:37:45.820
I just think that in terms of side-scrolling platformers,

00:37:46.000 --> 00:37:49.080
you are particularly powerless in this.

00:37:49.760 --> 00:37:56.060
Yeah. I have two thoughts about difficulty that will work into Lil' Nemo, sure,

00:37:56.120 --> 00:37:57.660
but just about gaming in general.

00:37:58.400 --> 00:38:03.660
And that is, first off, modern AAA games have ruined all perception of difficulty

00:38:03.660 --> 00:38:06.580
and sense of accomplishment for me personally,

00:38:06.580 --> 00:38:10.460
because I'm starting to realize that, like, it's not an accomplishment

00:38:10.460 --> 00:38:12.860
to beat any of these games that are released nowadays,

00:38:12.860 --> 00:38:15.840
because they're designed to be played through completely,

00:38:15.840 --> 00:38:18.040
and everybody wants you to see the ending.

00:38:18.320 --> 00:38:21.400
Like, nobody... I don't think anyone gave a shit on the NES

00:38:21.400 --> 00:38:24.220
if you ever saw any part of Mega Man

00:38:24.220 --> 00:38:26.200
other than what, you know, like, other than, like,

00:38:26.420 --> 00:38:27.740
what you saw on the box, right?

00:38:27.840 --> 00:38:30.280
Like, they weren't trying to be like, you know,

00:38:30.340 --> 00:38:32.340
oh, we gotta give these people a complete experience.

00:38:32.420 --> 00:38:33.380
Like, no, you just...

00:38:33.380 --> 00:38:36.340
You got what you got, and you didn't have the internet to find out about all this shit

00:38:36.340 --> 00:38:37.440
like we do on the podcast,

00:38:37.780 --> 00:38:40.000
so you would just be, like, amazed to learn

00:38:40.540 --> 00:38:42.360
from, like, seeing a friend do it

00:38:42.360 --> 00:38:43.560
